    - type: 6
      param: Fool
      intParam: 1
      card: {fileID: 0}
    - type: 7
      param: Fool
      intParam: 2
      card: {fileID: 0}
    npcText: Hello again my friend. Things seem to be moving along quite nicely.
    choices:
    - playerText: What are you plotting now?
      nextNodeIds:
      - ea41ac12639a5e97b1c689385b754bc3
      outcomes: []
    - playerText: Can you give me a hint of your plan?
      nextNodeIds:
      - c78badb370e7ea9bd9bfc6d04ef76190
      outcomes: []
    - playerText: "The kingdom suffers\u2026 are you ready to act?"
      nextNodeIds:
      - a8a99cf4fa040d342704c4ab4be02403
      outcomes: []
    - playerText: "I want to understand your vision\u2014I can help, if you trust
        me"
      nextNodeIds:
      - b5557592b6e62f447ceda2e4e8f6ce89
      outcomes: []
    - playerText: Tell me everything. How will the people rise?
      nextNodeIds:
      - 351f0b3190d436c85cc2e4ec49201488
      outcomes: []
    onEnterOutcomes: []
    nextNodeIds: []
  - nodeId: a8a99cf4fa040d342704c4ab4be02403
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f57a6cbc603399d4db1b2afbb697e7e3, type: 2}
    speakerSide: 0
    conditions: []
    npcText: Soon. Patience is part of the game. Act too early and it all crumbles.
    choices: []
    onEnterOutcomes: []
    nextNodeIds: []
  - nodeId: c78badb370e7ea9bd9bfc6d04ef76190
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f57a6cbc603399d4db1b2afbb697e7e3, type: 2}
    speakerSide: 0
    conditions: []
    npcText: "\u2026A hint? No. Some things must stay hidden, for the people are
      not yet ready."
    choices: []
    onEnterOutcomes: []
    nextNodeIds: []
  - nodeId: 80e496b62fee64c39dd8ed913bd22a09
